  },
  {
    "id": "c198",
    "name": "5.1.11 Licenses and permits",
    "text": "5.1.11 At its cost and expense, it has obtained (or will obtain when necessary to perform the services hereunder) and will maintain all necessary licenses, permits, franchises and regulatory approvals applicable to its business and the performance of the Services hereunder and the operation of the MTC Network."
  },
  {
