    "name": "5.1.12 Legal compliance",
    "text": "5.1.12 It is and will be in compliance with all laws, orders including court orders, and regulatory requirements applicable to the performance of its obligations under this Agreement."
  },
  {
    "id": "c200",
    "name": "5.1.13 Cooperation",
    "text": "5.1.13 It shall timely and diligently cooperate to effect the goals, objectives and purposes of this Agreement and to facilitate the performance of the respective duties and obligations of the Parties under this Agreement in a commercially reasonable manner."
  },
  {
