posed to be transferred (y) to any person or entity that is, or as to which a direct or indirect owner of 10% or more of the beneficial interest is, on a list of debarred or suspended entities for either the Commonwealth of Massachusetts or the United States Government, or (z) to any person or entity that is, or as to which a direct or indirect owner of sufficient voting shares to elect or control election of the board of directors is, engaged in business in competition with the MTC Network and has not given MTC reasonable, credible assurances that it will cause the Network Operator to continue using its best efforts to maximize Network Revenue and otherwise faithfully fulfill its obligations under this Agreement."
